        <p style="text-indent: 4em" rend="first-line-indent(4)" source="#source-12992-13057"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13004-13022"><rb>光</rb><rt>くわう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13022-13057">パラフヰンの　蒼いもや</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 4em" rend="first-line-indent(4)" source="#source-13057-13110"><seg source="#source-13057-13110">わをかく　わを描く　からす</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 4em" rend="first-line-indent(4)" source="#source-13110-13163"><seg source="#source-13110-13163">烏の軋り……からす器械……</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-13163-13198"><seg source="#source-13163-13198">（これはかはりますか）</seg></p>
