        <div>
          <head n="2" source="#source-64297-64339"><seg source="#source-64297-64303">芝生</seg></head>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-64345-64380"><seg source="#source-64345-64380">風とひのきのひるすぎに</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64380-64409"><seg source="#source-64380-64409">小田中はのびあがり</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64409-64444"><seg source="#source-64409-64444">あらんかぎり手をのばし</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64444-64491"><seg source="#source-64444-64491">灰いろのゴムのまり　光の標本を</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-64491-64529"><seg source="#source-64491-64529">受けかねてぽろつとおとす</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-64529-64579" style="padding-inline-end: 0em; text-align: right">
