        <div>
          <head n="2" source="#source-70975-71138"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71010-71061"><rb>原体剣舞連</rb><rt>はらたいけんばひれん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71063-71099">　　（mental sketch modified）</seg></head>
