        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-74760-74768"><seg source="#source-74760-74768">おお</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-74768-74797"><seg source="#source-74768-74797">何といふ立派な楢だ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-74797-74832"><seg source="#source-74797-74803">緑の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-74803-74827"><rb>勲爵士</rb><rt>ナイト</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-74827-74832">だ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-74832-74905"><seg source="#source-74832-74874">雨にぬれてまつすぐに立つ緑の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-74874-74898"><rb>勲爵士</rb><rt>ナイト</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-74898-74905">だ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-74905-74949"><seg source="#source-74905-74949">栗の木ばやしの青いくらがりに</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-74949-75005"><seg source="#source-74949-75005">しぶきや雨にびしやびしや洗はれてゐる</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-75005-75040"><seg source="#source-75005-75040">その長いものは一体舟か</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-75040-75063"><seg source="#source-75040-75063">それともそりか</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-75063-75100"><seg source="#source-75063-75100">あんまりロシヤふうだよ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-75100-75147"><seg source="#source-75100-75147">沼に生えるものはやなぎやサラド</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-75147-75191"><seg source="#source-75147-75159">きれいな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-75159-75174"><rb>蘆</rb><rt>よし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-75174-75191">のサラドだ</seg></p>
