      <div>
        <p source="#source-76012-76050"><seg source="#source-76012-76050">あめの稲田の中を行くもの</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-76050-76118"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76050-76092"><rb>海坊主林</rb><rt>うみばうずばやし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76092-76118">のはうへ急ぐもの</seg></p>
