        <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)" source="#source-76977-77033"><seg source="#source-76977-76992">交錯</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76992-77031"><rb>光乱転</rb><rt>くわうらんてん</rt></ruby></p>
        <p source="#source-77033-77053"><seg source="#source-77033-77053">気圏日本では</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-77053-77100"><seg source="#source-77053-77100">たうとう電線に銅をつかひ出した</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-77100-77132"><seg source="#source-77100-77132">（光るものは碍子</seg></p>
