      <div>
        <p source="#source-77338-77409"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-77338-77380"><rb>光波測定</rb><rt>くわうはそくてい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-77380-77383">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-77383-77401"><rb>誤差</rb><rt>ごさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-77401-77409">から</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-77409-77459"><seg source="#source-77409-77430">から松のしんは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-77430-77454"><rb>徒長</rb><rt>とちやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-77454-77459">し</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-77459-77512"><seg source="#source-77459-77471">柏の木の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-77471-77498"><rb>烏瓜</rb><rt>からすうり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-77498-77512">ランタン</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-77512-77553"><seg source="#source-77512-77553">（ひるの鳥は曠野に啼き</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)" source="#source-77553-77609"><seg source="#source-77553-77586">あざみは青い棘に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-77586-77601"><rb>遷</rb><rt>うつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-77601-77609">る）</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-77609-77644"><seg source="#source-77609-77644">太陽が梢に発射するとき</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-77644-77697"><seg source="#source-77644-77697">暗い林の入口にひとりたたずむものは</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-77697-77726"><seg source="#source-77697-77726">四角な若い樺の木で</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-77726-77755"><seg source="#source-77726-77755">Green Dwarf といふ品種</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-77755-77811"><seg source="#source-77755-77811">日光のために燃え尽きさうになりながら</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-77811-77852"><seg source="#source-77811-77852">燃えきらず青くけむるその木</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-77852-77881"><seg source="#source-77852-77881">羽虫は一疋づつ光り</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-77881-77904"><seg source="#source-77881-77904">鞍掛や銀の錯乱</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)" source="#source-77904-77960"><seg source="#source-77904-77960">（寛政十一年は百二十年前です）</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-77960-78013"><seg source="#source-77960-77975">そらの魚の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-77975-77990"><rb>涎</rb><rt>よだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-77990-78013">れはふりかかり</seg></p>
